OL,3,AJames Blunt on Traitors: I tried - and
OL,4,Afailed - to get banished
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe may have made it to the final
OL,7,Fepisode of this year's Celebrity
OL,8,FTraitors, but James Blunt says he did
OL,9,Fhis best to get banished from the show.
OL,11,FThe singer-songwriter became a fan
OL,12,Ffavourite for his 1980s leisurewear,
OL,13,Foutlandish conspiracy theories and
OL,14,Fmilitary-style approach to tasks.
OL,16,FA dominating presence at the round
OL,17,Ftable, he characterises himself as the
OL,18,F"yapping terrier" to actor Michael
OL,19,FSheen's "mature labrador", as they
OL,20,Fsniffed out the traitors.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
